'' '...' is only for a CDECL procedure, fbc's error 312 -- Linux, where a procedure that
'' writes no convention is cdecl, so only a convention written or a Windows block's is
'' refused. 11 errors on fbc-modern's Linux build, on exactly these lines (2026-09-19).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -target linux-x86_64 tests/diagnostics/src/vararg-cdecl.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 11
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(8,44): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(9,43): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'pascal'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(11,36): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(12,61): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(15,38): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(17,48): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(21,55): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(23,36): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(27,51): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
'' EXPECT-OUT: vararg-cdecl.bas(81,53): error TKO0781: '...' needs a 'cdecl' procedure, and this one is 'stdcall'
